    <h4 class="name" id="getByAuthor"><span class="type-signature">(async, generator) </span>getByAuthor<span class="signature">(author)</span><span class="type-signature"> &rarr; {AsyncIterable.&lt;<a href="global.html#Entity">Entity</a>>}</span></h4>
    

    



<div class="description">
    Get entities by author (hex public key).Scans the author's own UserCore directly, rather than the sharedview — a UserCore already only contains that person's own entities,so no separate author index is needed at all. Returns nothing if thisauthor's core hasn't been opened/replicated locally yet.
</div>









