            <td class="description last">Forwarded to the underlying Hypercore's get().  Notably opts.timeout: by default, get() with no options blocks  indefinitely if the block hasn't arrived yet, even if the core's  length has already synced (confirmed by reading Hypercore's own  get()/_get() implementation — with no timeout, the block request has  no bound at all).</td>
        </tr>

    
    </tbody>
</table>






