<div class="description">
    Resolve a scope's key for a given epoch, for a specific recipient.Unseals the recipient's own grant using their encryptionKeyPair — onlythe intended recipient (any of their devices, since encryptionKeyPairis stable per-identity) can actually do this.
</div>









