<div class="description">
    Remove a writer from the context. Same authorization/signing model asaddWriter() (unrestricted in open mode, signed + permission-checked inclosed mode). The Autobase-level removal itself refuses to remove thelast remaining indexer regardless of permission (host.removeWriter()throws in that case, which the apply layer catches and ignores ratherthan aborting the rest of the batch).
</div>









